1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,190
Listen to a talk on a business podcast.

2
00:00:04,190 --> 00:00:09,318
M: When launching a new business, entrepreneurs face countless decisions,

3
00:00:09,318 --> 00:00:13,100
from choosing a target market to deciding

4
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:17,010
which features to include in their first product.

5
00:00:17,010 --> 00:00:19,260
These choices can be overwhelming

6
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:23,290
especially when resources are limited and time is short.

7
00:00:23,290 --> 00:00:33,030
To address these challenges, some startups adopt a strategy that emphasizes speed, experimentation, and customer feedback.

8
00:00:33,030 --> 00:00:36,557
This approach, known as the Lean Startup methodology,

9
00:00:36,557 --> 00:00:43,170
was popularized by Eric Reese and has gained traction in the tech world and beyond.

10
00:00:43,170 --> 00:00:51,110
One of its core practices is building a minimum viable product, or MVP.

11
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:58,220
This is a basic version of a new product that can be released quickly to gather feedback from early users.

12
00:00:58,220 --> 00:01:01,540
The goal is to learn what works

13
00:01:01,540 --> 00:01:09,130
and what doesn't so that future development is guided by actual user experience rather than assumptions.

14
00:01:09,130 --> 00:01:13,090
Another key principle is validated learning.

15
00:01:13,090 --> 00:01:18,599
Instead of doing traditional market research like surveys or focus groups,

16
00:01:18,599 --> 00:01:25,110
entrepreneurs test their ideas by putting the product out in the real world.

17
00:01:25,110 --> 00:01:27,580
This helps them figure out

18
00:01:27,580 --> 00:01:32,010
whether their product actually meets the needs of their customers.

19
00:01:32,010 --> 00:01:37,220
In all fairness, I should point out that this approach isn't perfect.

20
00:01:37,220 --> 00:01:45,120
Rapid iteration and constant feedback can sometimes lead to confusion or a lack of clear direction.

21
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:49,780
And in the pursuit of efficiency, some teams may cut corners

22
00:01:50,420 --> 00:01:52,080
which could affect product quality.

23
00:01:52,080 --> 00:02:03,080
Still, many entrepreneurs find the Lean Startup methodology helpful for navigating the uncertainties of launching a new business.
